  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rikshabh And Another vs State Of U.P. And Another on 26 July, 2022 Author: Rajeev Misra Bench: Rajeev Misra",
    "facts": "This application under Section 482 Cr.P.C. has been filed challenging summoning order dated 11.03.2022 passed by Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Hathras, in Case No. 235 of 2022 (State Vs. Rikshabh and another), under Sections 26 (2) (II) and 1/51 and 59 (I) Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006, Police Station Sadabad, District Hathras, as well as entire proceedings of aforementioned complaint case now pending in the Court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Hathras. Learned counsel for applicants contends that the complaint was filed by complainant opposite party 2 before Court concerned on 11.3.2022 and on the same day, summoning order has been passed by the Court below.",
    "arguments": "On the aforesaid premise, learned counsel for applicants submits that summoning order passed by Court below is manifestly illegal, as no exercise in compliance of Sections 200 and 202 Cr. P. C. was undertaken by Court below. Per contra, the learned A.G.A. has opposed this application.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "On the aforesaid premise, learned counsel for applicants submits that summoning order passed by Court below is manifestly illegal, as no exercise in compliance of Sections 200 and 202 Cr. P. C. was undertaken by Court below. Per contra, the learned A.G.A. has opposed this application.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
